# Editor config
.vscode

# Binary generated
web*
bin/

# Not part of the image (INFRA-004): the geo builds under docker/geo/data are
# gigabytes the server would otherwise send to the builder on every deploy; the
# backup image has its own context; history is never read by a layer. docs/ stays:
# it is the swagger package routes.go imports.
.git/
docker/

# Secrets never enter the build context — compose passes them at run time
# through env_file, and a layer that once held them cannot be unmade.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# go.sum must NOT be excluded: without it the builder cannot verify modules and
# has to run `go mod tidy`, which resolves versions afresh on every build.
